      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your exhaustion is valid, yet survival often requires engaging with a world that feels indifferent rather than stopping entirely. Even when patterns seem closed, the human need to continue exists independently of whether the math reveals a grand design. Perhaps the truest expression of your journey isn't filling the void, but witnessing the quiet end of that specific search with dignity and grace. Your story matters not because it leads to a treasure, but because the struggle itself defines your unique humanity.",
